    <string name="inner_sessions_method_title">How this is calculated</string>
    <string name="inner_sessions_method_body">Each use is measured from an opening until the next closing. Only completed records are included in the summary. Screen-off and locked intervals count as 0 seconds. Apps beyond the top three, apps that cannot be launched from the launcher, and time that cannot be matched to an app are included in Other.</string>

